// Backend configuration for the iOS app.
//
// Leave this blank and SplitFree never contacts a server: no sign-in screen, no
// sync, every group stays on the device. That is a supported way to run the app,
// not a broken build.
//
// To turn sync on, paste your Supabase project's host and anon key below.
// Find both in the Supabase dashboard under Project Settings -> API.
//
// Write the host WITHOUT "https://". Two forward slashes start a comment in this
// file format, so a pasted URL would be silently cut off at "https:" and the app
// would fail to reach anything with no clue why.
//
//   Right:  SUPABASE_URL = abcdefghijkl.supabase.co
//   Wrong:  SUPABASE_URL = https://abcdefghijkl.supabase.co
//
// Both values are safe to commit. The anon key grants nothing on its own: every
// table denies by default and row-level security decides the rest. It ships
// inside the app binary regardless, so keeping it out of the repo buys nothing.

SUPABASE_URL =
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY =
